|---|---|
| file | `yaro1214/open_data/perfectblend_train_regen_temperature0_no_think.jsonl` (6.32 GB) |
| content | Open Perfect Blend prompts, regenerated by Qwen3-8B at temperature 0, non-thinking |
| rows | 1,420,909 |
| chat_template | `qwen3-instruct` with the implicit system prompt removed (PR #942 layer #959), i.e. no system prompt |
| max_length | 8192 |
