## Draft model (`configs/qwen3-8b-dspark-causal-noconf-b16.json`, identical to jiapingW's draft_config.json)

| item | setting |
|---|---|
| architecture | DSparkDraftModel, dense |
| attention direction | `is_causal: true` (causal inside the draft block, PR #942 layer #960) |
| block_size | 16 |
| layers / hidden / FFN | 5 / 4096 / 12288, all full attention |
| attention heads / KV heads / head_dim | 32 / 8 / 128 (GQA) |
| target feature layers | 1, 9, 17, 25, 33 (target has 36 layers) |
| Markov head | vanilla, rank 256 |
| confidence head | off |
| projector | dspark |
| mask_token_id | 151669 |
| max_position_embeddings / rope_theta | 40960 / 1e6 |
| vocab | 151936, untied embedding (frozen copy of the target embedding) |

## Training

| item | setting |
|---|---|
| strategy | dspark |
| epochs | 12 (one run; steps computed from the data, about 11,100 per epoch, about 133,200 total) |
| effective global batch | 128 = batch_size 2 x accumulation_steps 8 x 8 ranks |
| learning rate / schedule | 6e-4, cosine over the 12 epochs, warm-up 4% |
| max_grad_norm | 1.0 |
| optimizer | AdamW, FP32 master params, weight_decay 0 |
| num_anchors | 512 |
| loss_decay_gamma | 7.0 |
| objective_chunk_blocks | 128 |
| loss | 0.1 CE + 0.9 L1, confidence loss 0 |
| attention_backend | flex_attention |
| sharding | NO_SHARD (DDP), `ddp_bucket_cap_mb` 128 |
| vocabulary projection | `cache_vocab_projection: true`, `flatten_vocab_projection: true` (PR #942 layer #963; the published run's `dspark_cache_projection` / `dspark_flatten_projection`) |
| dtype / kernels | bfloat16, Liger kernels |
| save_interval / max_checkpoints / log_interval | 11,100 (= one epoch) / 3 / 10 |
| seed / prompt_seed | 42 / 42 |
| consumer dispatch / in-flight window | `cost_balanced` (PR #942 layer #966), 4 optimizer quanta in flight (`in_flight_high_watermark` 512, low 384) |
| capture servers | 8x SGLang 0.5.18 (spec-capture patch), TP1 bf16, triton attention, context 8208, 4 running requests, Mooncake RDMA |

PR #942 layers merged into this branch (stack #957 to #963): streaming-read fix (#957), DDP no_sync around forward+backward and
`ddp_bucket_cap_mb` (#958), empty qwen3-instruct system prompt (#959), independent attention range/direction, `is_causal` (#960),
DFlash fused plain head (#961, DFlash only, unused here), selective checkpoint contexts for frozen projections (#962), shared
Domino/DSpark vocabulary projection controls `cache_vocab_projection` / `flatten_vocab_projection` (#963), DSpine algorithm
(#965, unused here, dependency of #966), cost-balanced consumer dispatch `runtime.consumer_dispatch` (#966). Not merged: #967
(RTX PRO5000 recipes).

