## Reproduce

```bash
# both nodes (idempotent: clone, SGLang patch, model; trainer node also pip, corpus, secrets from /personal/dense-secrets)
git clone -b dense-same https://github.com/yushengsu-thu/SpecForge.git /scratch/dense/SpecForge
bash /scratch/dense/SpecForge/scripts/launch/dense-same/setup_node.sh <0|1>
# rank 0 (capture): model + 8 servers
hf download Qwen/Qwen3-8B --local-dir /scratch/models/Qwen3-8B
bash scripts/launch/dense-same/capture_node.sh <CAPTURE_IP> <TRAINER_IP>
# rank 1 (trainer): data, secrets, trainer + watcher
pip install -e /scratch/dense/SpecForge --no-deps && pip install liger-kernel
hf download Qwen/Qwen3-8B --local-dir /scratch/models/Qwen3-8B
hf download yaro1214/open_data perfectblend_train_regen_temperature0_no_think.jsonl --repo-type dataset --local-dir /scratch/dense/data
# /scratch/dense/hf_token, /scratch/dense/wandb_key (mode 600)
bash scripts/launch/dense-same/trainer_node.sh <CAPTURE_IP> <TRAINER_IP>
# crash: RESUME_FROM=/scratch/dense/outputs/dense-same/dense-same-step<N> bash scripts/launch/dense-same/trainer_node.sh <CAPTURE_IP> <TRAINER_IP>
```
